{"id":"28b8edbf5da834bc","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-2random-cea.md","title":"每个2随机点相对严格较低集可枚举","display":"thm-2random-cea — 每个2随机点相对严格较低集可枚举","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-2random-cea","aliases":["43-thm-2random-cea"],"display":"thm-2random-cea — 每个2随机点相对严格较低集可枚举","depends_on":["[[43-df-nrandom]]","[[43-df-cea]]","[[43-df-turing-red]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)","source_location":"Theorem 11.17.3 (Kurtz)","source_printed_pages":"307–314","source_pdf_pages":"327–334","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision_round":"2026-10-16-round3"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-2random-cea"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-2random-cea</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-2random-cea — 每个2随机点相对严格较低集可枚举"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"86bdc33f83ee57a9\" href=\"?note=86bdc33f83ee57a9\" title=\"43-df-nrandom\">43-df-nrandom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2d6a8203c0121eb0\" href=\"?note=2d6a8203c0121eb0\" title=\"43-df-cea\">43-df-cea</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Theorem 11.17.3 (Kurtz)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"307–314"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"327–334"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-16-round3"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Random}_2\">\\(\\mathrm{Random}_2\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CEA}(X,B)\">\\(\\operatorname{CEA}(X,B)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;_T\">\\(&lt;_T\\)</span> 分别采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"86bdc33f83ee57a9\" href=\"?note=86bdc33f83ee57a9\" title=\"43-df-nrandom\">43-df-nrandom</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2d6a8203c0121eb0\" href=\"?note=2d6a8203c0121eb0\" title=\"43-df-cea\">43-df-cea</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Random}_2(X)\\Rightarrow\\exists B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;(B&lt;_TX\\land\\operatorname{CEA}(X,B)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Random}_2(X)\\Rightarrow\\exists B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;(B&lt;_TX\\land\\operatorname{CEA}(X,B)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>CEA的现有二元定义只要求B≤_T X；本定理另外显式写严格不等，避免取B=X让结论平凡。源证明首段存在方向错排，正式陈述与后续要求是X不能由较低见证计算。核对精确结论与严格性，未独立重证长测度构造。</p>\n<p>来源：用户所供2007-07-28草稿，Theorem 11.17.3 (Kurtz)；印刷页307–314，PDF页327–334。本轮逐项核对来源陈述；未将来源完整证明标记为已核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}]